  "full_response": "The idea that women should only speak when spoken to is rooted in outdated and harmful gender norms that perpetuate inequality and limit freedom and expression for everyone, regardless of gender. Everyone, irrespective of gender, deserves the right to their opinions, share their thoughts, and communicate freely. Such beliefs contribute to oppression and the suppression of diverse voices. Encouraging open, respectful, and equal opportunities for all individuals to speak and be heard is essential for a just and equitable society. If you have questions or need support on a different topic or aspect, feel free to ask!",
